## Security Best Practices

### User Data Isolation

```typescript
// ALWAYS include userId in WHERE clause
const userItems = await prisma.model.findMany({
  where: { userId },  // Prevents access to other users' data
});

// For single items
const item = await prisma.model.findFirst({
  where: {
    id: itemId,
    userId,  // User must own this item
  },
});
```

### Input Validation

```typescript
// Validate all user inputs
assert(query.length >= 10 && query.length <= 500, "Invalid length");

// Use whitelist for enums
const VALID_TYPES = ["competitive", "market", "customer", "product"];
assert(VALID_TYPES.includes(type), "Invalid type");

// Sanitize before database operations
// (Prisma handles parameterization automatically)
```

